# #136 CRLF, three parsers, all measured 2026-09-17 at f306cee:
#   ops-reverify.sh  MY OWN REGRESSION from the #128 fix. Swapping the prefix
#     glob `"| Gate | Criterion |"*` for exact equality removed the `*` that
